  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The deep gouges across the surface tell of ancient struggles against a tide of shadow. While its face is weathered, the balance of the wood and metal remains perfect, granting the one who carries it a quiet grace in movement and a keenness of hearing."
    }
